NAME
       test - check files and compare values

SYNOPSIS
       test expression
       [ expression ]

DESCRIPTION
       test is the shell's test builtin as a program, for callers
       that cannot reach a builtin: find -exec test, xargs test,
       env test. It uses the same code as the builtin (see sh(1)
       for the expressions). Called by the name [, its last
       argument must be ].

       There is no /bin/[ in the image yet: a program cannot be
       named [ under bin/. Inside the shell, [ is the builtin.

EXIT STATUS
       0 if the expression is true, 1 if it is false, 2 on an
       error.

SEE ALSO
       sh(1)

